{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ec1c1cbb-e156-5b27-b802-21355330794c", "source_ordinal": 2486, "reading_ordinal": 1567, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "主见", "published_at": "2022-12-17T21:15:03+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/562074341/answer/2805611074"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你是喜欢扫地机器人还是喜欢扫把？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你是喜欢智能洗衣机还是搓衣板？", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你是喜欢智能电饭煲还是柴火灶？", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "从“有主见”的角度来说，显然前者都比后者有主见得多，而且都是给你打工的。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你作为老板，你是喜欢前者还是喜欢后者？", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 105}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以，问题出在“有主见”上吗？", "char_start": 106, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "实话告诉你——没有任何一个神智正常的领导会反感下属有主见。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 151}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "ta们只会反感你没有主见——“没有主见”无非是想耍“都是你说的”这种逃避责任的花招。", "char_start": 152, "char_end": 194}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "ta们反感的，是你超越自己的负责范围，不经授权擅自决定、干预一些你自己不承担全部或部分责任的事。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 244}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "就像一台扫地机器人，非要去篡改Wi-Fi密码，劫持摄像头。", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这根本就不是“有没有主见”的问题，而是盗窃ta人合法权利的问题。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "被厌恶的是盗窃，不是“有主见”。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 324}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0241"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么有些领导不喜欢太有主见的员工？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“主见”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你是喜欢扫地机器人还是喜欢扫把？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你是喜欢扫地机器人还是喜欢扫把？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0d21e055-7d5e-578d-96d7-f055bc7f64bb", "source_ordinal": 2485, "reading_ordinal": 1568, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "独立游戏", "published_at": "2022-12-18T00:15:10+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/572682102/answer/2805798903"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你们需要明白现在的世界秩序是什么东西。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "简单点来说，在单极世界——甚至双极世界——的架构下，小国家——尤其是不超过500万人口的小国家，会自动沦为超级强国的殖民地。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "因为这些小国家实际上根本无法独立的行使主权。面对原主权国或者强邻的敌意和武力威胁，势必要全面依靠化名为“国际社会”的超级强国的庇护生存。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 151}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "换句话来说，从超级强国的视角来看，一个地区“独立”，其实和这个地区“接受占领”“接受统治”，在本质上是同一个意思。", "char_start": 152, "char_end": 209}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "本质上，那根本不是“独立”，而是叛变。因为分裂出去之后，分裂的地区根本就不会因此拥有什么独立主权，它只是换了一个主人侍奉而已。", "char_start": 210, "char_end": 273}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以，很自然的，超级强国会本能的希望，甚至积极促成其他国家的各个地区“独立”，会开动自己的舆论机器去极力赞美这种行为。", "char_start": 274, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这实际上是一种化名为“支持民主和自由”的侵略，是一种使用厨刀的谋杀，一种包上了金箔的贪婪罢了。", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 381}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "但恰恰也因为是这样，这样的机制也会自动的将不甘心丧失主权的所有次要大国团结起来，为超级强国的失败埋下种子。", "char_start": 382, "char_end": 435}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "塞尔维亚的敌人其实并不止是科索沃，还包括热衷于从分裂他国中牟利的国家，难度是很大的。", "char_start": 436, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这才是塞尔维亚困难的地方。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 492}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0241"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：阿尔巴尼亚需要多大的努力才能让科索沃回归？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“独立游戏”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你们需要明白现在的世界秩序是什么东西。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你们需要明白现在的世界秩序是什么东西。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "62b47ce9-2a74-596c-89dd-3eea01da2eb5", "source_ordinal": 2484, "reading_ordinal": 1569, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "该与不该", "published_at": "2022-12-18T12:07:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/569816053/answer/2806187887"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "以下几个事实是明确的：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）作为成年人，你可以参与公共讨论。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "2）作为公民，你可以主张其他人应该享有法律赋予的权利。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "3）在没有明确授权的前提下，你不能自行主张自己的看法就是某个其他人的看法。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "4）在缺少侦查手段和专业训练的前提下，你缺少判断真相、避免误导的能力。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 132}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "简单的来说——", "char_start": 133, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "heading", "index": 7, "text": "你有这个权利，但“有权利”并不是你“应该做某某事”的全部必要理由。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "很多人仅仅是为了品尝这个权利的快感——或者不如说是因为有权利的焦虑、害怕这个权利是假的，所以要不考虑后果的用一用，好确认自己真的有这个权利。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "就像刚成年的小孩子要用熬夜来验证自己真的有了熬夜的权利，用放纵证明自己真的有了放纵的权利一样。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "问题是，事实上你该不该做什么事，并不取决于你是否有某个权利，还要取决于做这件事是利大于弊还是弊大于利。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 345}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如果一件事弊大于利，意味着即使人类社会给了你权利，但是自然法并没有给。", "char_start": 346, "char_end": 381}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "heading", "index": 12, "text": "永远记住——在自然法面前，人类法根本不值一文。", "char_start": 382, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "考虑问题要养成习惯、练成本能的思考这事自然法的裁决是什么，而不要首先关心人类法的裁决是什么。", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 452}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "人类法禁止的，意味着自然法在通过人类法做了相对限制——不要忘了人类法是自然法的结果，是自然法通过社会机制所做的曲折表达。", "char_start": 453, "char_end": 513}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但是人类法允许的，自然法未必同意。", "char_start": 514, "char_end": 531}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "人类法会影响你可做什么，不可做什么——但是注意，这只是影响，并不是决定。", "char_start": 532, "char_end": 568}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "人类法在本质上只是通过改变你做事的成本来改变你达成目的的概率。这归根结底只是一种影响，一种“有力的建议”。", "char_start": 569, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "自然法才是决定你该做什么、不该做什么的真正法官。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 647}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "该与不该，人回答你的不算。", "char_start": 648, "char_end": 661}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "去向历史要答案，因为历史就是自然法判决的总和。", "char_start": 662, "char_end": 685}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18, "heading": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0241"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：年轻人到底该不该为社会问题发声呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“该与不该”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“以下几个事实是明确的：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "以下几个事实是明确的：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "afeb2d17-8a39-5bca-a8b2-6793d3fc2ef0", "source_ordinal": 2483, "reading_ordinal": 1570, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "摄像头", "published_at": "2022-12-18T19:28:38+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/568989207/answer/2806660459"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "办法很简单——先考个90分，然后再指出：“要是没有摄像头，我也许可以考95到100”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "如果你本来就是70分甚至不及格，这一招就用不上。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是唯一正解。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 76}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "“破坏摄像头”、“哀求”、“抗议”，都是胡扯淡。", "char_start": 77, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "说得直白点——之所以父母敢于使用这些手段，逻辑上首先就因为ta们觉得没什么可失去的了。", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 145}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你只有让对方明确感受到有可失去的收益，才有可能改变对方的决策。", "char_start": 146, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "那么“威胁自残”行不行呢？“大吵大闹”、“打砸烧”行不行呢？这难道不能作为“可以造成的损失”来用吗？", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "heading", "index": 8, "text": "不行。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 232}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "看清楚，“摄像头妨碍我考一百分”，造成的损失不是你去制造的，而是客观存在的，是对方行为的逻辑后果。", "char_start": 233, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但是“你安装摄像头我就防火烧房子”，造成的损失是你制造出来的，是你的行为的逻辑后果。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "要避免前者，当事人会改变自己的行为。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "要避免后者，对当事人却是一个不畏强暴的问题。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "人必须明智的追求自己的利益，人也必须不畏强暴。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "所以走后一条路在逻辑上就是愚蠢行为。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 410}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "在这集思广益出主意，想创意，教人走后面这条路的，自己都不知道自己在干什么，连人的基本行为模式都一无所知。", "char_start": 411, "char_end": 463}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "现在问题来了——", "char_start": 464, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你是不是没有什么可以拿来作为筹码的成就和表现？", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 496}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "heading", "index": 18, "text": "你为什么没有？", "char_start": 497, "char_end": 504}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16, "heading": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0241"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何悄悄破坏一个摄像头，急？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“摄像头”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“办法很简单——先考个90分，然后再指出：“要是没有摄像头，我也许可以考95到100”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "办法很简单——先考个90分，然后再指出：“要是没有摄像头，我也许可以考95到100”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1bbde9dd-b5d7-50d1-a07c-35915898a82b", "source_ordinal": 2482, "reading_ordinal": 1571, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "非法改装", "published_at": "2022-12-18T22:10:34+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/333558440/answer/2806850147"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "发几张图给你开开眼：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你可能会叫起来——那我改的是GTR，我改的是发动机、排气管，这改的是大货车、改的是货斗啊。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "很遗憾，“非法改装”这扇门一推开，允许你改发动机排气管，就等于允许人家货车改车厢。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "就像“允许违法”的门一推开，就不可能再区分闯红灯和强奸。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为如果划出这条“允许线”，实质上只是修改了法律、扩大了“合法”的定义，并不叫做“允许某些非法行为”。", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个世界上有一种说得震山响的蠢论——就是喜欢打着“反对一刀切”的旗号，搞司法打折。", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 223}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "其实律令如果不是一刀切，本质上就是个摆设。", "char_start": 224, "char_end": 245}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-12/18/0c71dfdeb88338257c69eac83cbf7b93.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-12/18/9a688871cce711d3e894b16d6b24b3f1.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG003", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-12/18/332f5968f50318b4babc36520190bf94.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG004", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-12/18/c996520962608d9c026eb24aa8f039c6.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15, "image": 4}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0241"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么国家要严打改装车？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“非法改装”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“发几张图给你开开眼：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "发几张图给你开开眼：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0e8bd1e2-2393-58b6-b8c3-cd1acaa9cf6a", "source_ordinal": 2481, "reading_ordinal": 1572, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "长一智", "published_at": "2022-12-19T01:27:37+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/44268e4a7ef911edabaf52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "我其实还挺乐观的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为会出结果——", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "要么事实就教育了民众，“放开是可以承受的”。于是一切都自然会好转。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "要么事实就教育了民众，“放开只会更糟糕”。", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "于是再怨气冲天阴阳怪气不配合防疫的人被依法惩处，大家认真的齐心协力的配合严格清零。", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "无论哪个，都要比之前悬而未决然后一大群人私下作乱要好。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "吃一堑，长一智，这是人类进步的正常路径。", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 165}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "只要长了一智，吃了一堑就不应该被视为损失，而应该视为盈利应有的成本。", "char_start": 166, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而很快，我们无论如何都会长一智，无非看长的是哪一智而已。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 229}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "长完这一智，一切必然向上，而且是真正的解决问题，不再受到三心二意的无谓损失。", "char_start": 230, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "天下大乱，形势大好。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这是好事，耐心即可。", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不要大惊小怪。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 298}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0241"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待疫情放开后的实体经济？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“长一智”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我其实还挺乐观的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我其实还挺乐观的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e3301871-3696-5787-8878-1bbf15126a64", "source_ordinal": 2480, "reading_ordinal": 1573, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "那山高", "published_at": "2022-12-19T22:49:32+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/288426457/answer/2808255002"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不光是平静，甚至还有点期待。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "但这个期待并不是“痛得不行，咋还不死”这种。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而是活有活的好，死有死的好，活的好已经耳熟能详，死的好尚未识荆。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "具体来说，是望着天花板眼睛滴溜溜的转，暗自盘算怎么才能混个密钥，搞个周末通行证，从那边打什么擦边球传点消息过来。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这要是搞成了，岂不酷哉。", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 140}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 5}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0241"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：人临死前是非常平静还是非常恐惧的？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005"], "summary": "围绕“那山高”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不光是平静，甚至还有点期待。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不光是平静，甚至还有点期待。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4a02adb9-819d-5c72-a379-945bec79f3b9", "source_ordinal": 2479, "reading_ordinal": 1574, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "锤子的个人理解", "published_at": "2022-12-20T11:24:56+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/316295224/answer/2808740846"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你们有没有想过这样一个问题——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "为什么“认清现实”似乎总是一种“迎头一棒，在沉重打击下梦想幻灭”的意思？", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "为什么它不能是“没想到现实远比我害怕的样子美好”？", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "为什么不是？", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "仅仅因为“年轻人肯定没经验，总是要先遭遇失败，失败当然总是会受到沉重打击”吗？", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 125}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "魔鬼就在这里了——凭什么“失败造成严重打击”就一定会导致“幻想破灭”呢？", "char_start": 126, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你们有没有想过——", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 172}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "在遭受这个失败、受到这个沉重打击的时候，如果有出乎意料的救援，以至于转危为安，这个必然到来的沉重打击就不会导致你的乐观崩溃？", "char_start": 173, "char_end": 235}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "失败来临，自由落体，但却出乎你意料的被接住了，你得到的结论就不会是“社会多么险恶，我清醒了”，而会是恰恰相反——", "char_start": 236, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "“世界比我想象的更安全。”", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你是因为没有那个“被接住”，结结实实的摔碎在水泥地上了，所以你的乐观才会崩溃。", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而你在思考这个问题的时候，甚至都没有想到过还有这样一种“失败并不带来绝望”的可能性。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 389}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你崩溃，你绝望，并不是因为你失败——这种失败人人都注定会遇到，但却并不是人人都因为这失败变得消沉绝望。", "char_start": 390, "char_end": 441}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而是因为你失败时，没有被挽救。", "char_start": 442, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "为什么没有被挽救？", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 468}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "两个原因。", "char_start": 469, "char_end": 474}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "第一个，通俗点讲，是因为你把“路人缘”败光了。", "char_start": 475, "char_end": 498}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "人非草木，皆有恻隐之心，尤其是看到有小孩子做蠢事，多少都会愿意伸手拉一把。别看有时候只是一句“没事吧”，但这句“没事吧”后面常有做出牺牲的准备。", "char_start": 499, "char_end": 571}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "而拯救你需要什么呢？其实只需要恰当的人几个“没事吧”级别的举手之劳——尤其是在问题出现的早期。", "char_start": 572, "char_end": 619}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "除了这对方发起的“没事吧”之外，还有一大堆人是你可以主动去求助的，只是你因为“这样那样的原因”，不肯开口而已。", "char_start": 620, "char_end": 675}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "为什么不肯开口？", "char_start": 676, "char_end": 684}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "因为你做这件事的目的，就是想要证明“你们所有人都错了”，不是吗？", "char_start": 685, "char_end": 717}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你看到你为什么会摔得粉碎了吧？", "char_start": 718, "char_end": 733}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "搞这种“我要证明你们所有人都错了”的事业，咋还能求助呢？搞这种事业，任何人的主动帮助、任何人要给你出主意，都是在破坏你自证伟大的事业有效性，形同在你的皇冠上撬宝石。", "char_start": 734, "char_end": 816}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "没骂一顿，憋着还笑脸相迎，已经都算宽宏大量了，不是吗？", "char_start": 817, "char_end": 844}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "自己去向人求助，更是把皇冠送人，简直不可想象，不是吗？", "char_start": 845, "char_end": 872}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你选了这种项目，一起步就先把所有的安全绳都剪断了，等你从那万剑铸成的铁王座上掉下来，你摔个嘴啃泥，该怪“世人太冷漠”吗？", "char_start": 873, "char_end": 933}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "第二种，就是你选的是永动机项目。", "char_start": 934, "char_end": 950}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "要“证明自己”嘛，大概率成功的普通计划有啥意思，难道用炒个蛋炒饭、做个小板凳来证明自己不残疾？", "char_start": 951, "char_end": 998}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "要搞就搞反重力的、黑魔法的，“现实扭曲”湿湿碎啦。", "char_start": 999, "char_end": 1024}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这种是真的全人类来帮、把整个地球搞破产也搞不定。", "char_start": 1025, "char_end": 1049}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "谁帮也没用，谁帮谁破产，而你却认为只有这项目才能“证明我自己”，而且“再不证明我自己，我就感觉不到我活着了”。", "char_start": 1050, "char_end": 1105}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你想想，这个配置会是什么结果？", "char_start": 1106, "char_end": 1121}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "世界的保护其实已经很周全了，第一你不要搞这种“证明所有人都错了”的项目，第二你别选挑战自然规律的项目。", "char_start": 1123, "char_end": 1174}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "你不搞这两种——实际上这两种往往是同一种——自寻死路的项目，你将有很大的概率从“必然因为经验不足而遭遇的首次失败”得到“世界出乎意料的安全”的结论。", "char_start": 1175, "char_end": 1249}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "现在，问一下你自己——", "char_start": 1250, "char_end": 1261}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "你为什么对“证明你们全都错了”有如此迫切的需求？", "char_start": 1262, "char_end": 1286}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "归根到底，是因为你要惩罚ta们未对你尽爱的义务，不是吗？", "char_start": 1287, "char_end": 1315}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "何以见得ta们没有对你尽到爱的义务？", "char_start": 1316, "char_end": 1334}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "因为尽到爱的义务的样子应该像广告、电视剧和网文、社交媒体上演的、写的那样，是吗？", "char_start": 1335, "char_end": 1375}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "是吗？", "char_start": 1376, "char_end": 1379}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "heading", "index": 42, "text": "是吗？", "char_start": 1380, "char_end": 1383}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "凭什么就“是”？", "char_start": 1385, "char_end": 1393}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "凭什么？", "char_start": 1394, "char_end": 1398}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "这些人算是什么东西？凭什么这些人为了赚钱写的最能赚钱的东西就等于真理？", "char_start": 1399, "char_end": 1434}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "你看懂没有？", "char_start": 1436, "char_end": 1442}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "你陷入你现在的绝望，是因为你拜在了拜在财神门下的人的门下。", "char_start": 1443, "char_end": 1472}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "拜财神都拜成下线，简直笑出泪。", "char_start": 1473, "char_end": 1488}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "还是泪出笑？", "char_start": 1489, "char_end": 1495}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "这个世界上的爱只有一种，而且是不容人误认的。绝不是什么鬼扯的“各人有各人的理解”。", "char_start": 1497, "char_end": 1538}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "你可以“个人理解”，理解错了就给你迎头一锤，让你个人再理解。", "char_start": 1539, "char_end": 1569}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "游戏规则都设计成这样了，你说正确的理解到底是谁的理解？", "char_start": 1570, "char_end": 1597}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "是你的个人理解吗？", "char_start": 1598, "char_end": 1607}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "——是锤子的个人理解。", "char_start": 1608, "char_end": 1619}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "做父母的，你们一定要记住——", "char_start": 1621, "char_end": 1635}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "你不可能避免子女遭受ta的首次失败，", "char_start": 1636, "char_end": 1654}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "但是这个失败带来“世界一片漆黑”，还是“世界出乎意料的安全”，你有努力的空间。", "char_start": 1655, "char_end": 1694}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "避免子女因失败而绝望，这是你们对子女的关键责任，远在避免ta们失败之上。", "char_start": 1695, "char_end": 1731}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "后者甚至一开始就不应该是你追求的目标。", "char_start": 1732, "char_end": 1751}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "body", "index": 60, "text": "把这些答案看完。", "char_start": 1753, "char_end": 1761}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 66, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0241"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：你是什么时候认清现实的？在此之前有过什么美好的臆想呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060"], "summary": "围绕“锤子的个人理解”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你们有没有想过这样一个问题——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你们有没有想过这样一个问题——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
